{"id":"f7a62d467b0cda70","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-set9-finite-support-function.md","title":"ZFC Set9 Finite Support Function","display":"df-zfc-set9-finite-support-function — ZFC Set9 Finite Support Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set9-finite-support-function","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set9-finite-support-function"],"display":"df-zfc-set9-finite-support-function — ZFC Set9 Finite Support Function","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-set-support-of-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set9-finite-support-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set9-finite-support-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set9-finite-support-function — ZFC Set9 Finite Support Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"07554a796c3aa1f5\" href=\"?note=07554a796c3aa1f5\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fbacbc666088e500\" href=\"?note=fbacbc666088e500\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-set-support-of-function.md\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-set-support-of-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,z,S\\in V\">\\(f,z,S\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{ZfcSetSupportOfFunction}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{ZfcSetSupportOfFunction}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet9FiniteSupportFunction}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet9FiniteSupportFunction}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}finite\\text{-}support\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet9FiniteSupportFunction}_S(f,z)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}\n(f,\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\cup\\{z\\})\n\\land\n\\exists S\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcSetSupportOfFunction}_S(S,f,z)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S(S)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}finite\\text{-}support\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet9FiniteSupportFunction}_S(f,z)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}\n(f,\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\cup\\{z\\})\n\\land\n\\exists S\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcSetSupportOfFunction}_S(S,f,z)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S(S)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Support is relative to a declared default value; without <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span>, the original\nexpression <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{supp}(f)\">\\(\\operatorname{supp}(f)\\)</span> was not determined by an arbitrary\nset-valued function.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"07554a796c3aa1f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-set-support-of-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"fbacbc666088e500","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-set-support-of-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,z,S\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{ZfcSetSupportOfFunction}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet9FiniteSupportFunction}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set9\\text{-}finite\\text{-}support\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcSet9FiniteSupportFunction}_S(f,z)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}\n(f,\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\cup\\{z\\})\n\\land\n\\exists S\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcSetSupportOfFunction}_S(S,f,z)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S(S)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{supp}(f)","display":false}],"bytes":1323,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3457","lo